# CR 508.1f: a vigilant attacker does not tap when declared -- Wilt-Leaf Cavaliers
# (3/4, Vigilance) attacks unblocked and stays untapped, unlike
# every plain attacker fixture (combat-vigilance-attacker-stays-untapped is
# the original; this is the same rule against a different corpus card).
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
